part records
  tally 1
  note "Bank Olcha's exports of the joint account. tally 1.0.1 can't read them as they stand (no import for a |-separated file with yyyymmdd dates, decimal commas, space thousands, header lines and a balance-after column: observation O:D-1, household A's O:A-1). Only the rows a question reads are written here, each citing its file and line; every other row is left out, so no version says covers and nothing here sums an export."
  note "Each export's version is known on the first day after its month: the files name no export day (assumed)."

index olcha_row: open

input bank[r in olcha_row]: movement DUK

